    "$x = s + \\epsilon$\n",
    "\n",
    "where, $\\epsilon \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma ^2)$ \n",
    "\n",
    "and\n",
    "\n",
    "$s \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, 1)$"
